# the same program with the calls of built-ins withheld: the call goes by value, and whatever is called so may run any code
# RUN: walk f1 mechanisms=-BuiltinCalls
# CHECK-LABEL: code f1:Body
# CHECK: = Call {{*}}mayCallUnknownCode
# RUN(NEVER): walk f1 mechanisms=-BuiltinCalls
# NEVER-NOT: CallBuiltin
# PROGRAM-OF: json-stringify-of-plain-data-calls-no-unknown-code.ir
